{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"BIT-kyverno-2026-122305","published":"2026-11-17T11:49:07.200Z","modified":"2026-11-17T13:40:41.852332717Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-122305","GHSA-338x-hgrv-626h"],"summary":"Kyverno before 1.19.2 Denial of Service via Nested Variable Substitution Loop","details":"Kyverno before 1.19.2 contains a denial of service vulnerability in substituteVariablesIfAny that allows low-privileged users to hang the admission webhook via self-referential variable templates. Attackers can create resources whose annotations re-introduce the embedded policy variable, causing unbounded substitution loops that exhaust CPU and memory and block cluster-wide admission.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"kyverno","ecosystem":"Bitnami","purl":"pkg:bitnami/kyverno"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.19.2"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/bitnami/vulndb/tree/main/data/kyverno/BIT-kyverno-2026-122305.json"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V4","score":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:H/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X"}]}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://github.com/kyverno/kyverno/security/advisories/GHSA-338x-hgrv-626h"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-122305"},{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/kyverno-before-1.19.2-denial-of-service-via-nested-variable-substitution-loop"}],"database_specific":{"cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:kyverno:kyverno:*:*:*:*:*:go:*:*"],"severity":"High"}}